\n\nThe answer is saved at `/var/folders/4_/s6fbcjyn4b13xdxkd3lv0kw00000gn/T/arm-s21d5-post-1-zp848l9z/work/answer.md`. The task asked for `answer.md` in the working-files directory, and that is where I put it."
